msgstr ""
"Technical requirement catalogs for accessible web content. An evaluation "
"against them covers far more than the three patterns of this plugin."

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:505
msgid "Musterprüfung"
msgstr "Pattern check"

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:506
